    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control</strong> the <strong>Elf Archer</strong> to move <strong>up/down</strong>, swiftly <strong>attacking</strong> or <strong>dodging</strong> the raptors' ambush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raptors will attack from <strong>various directions</strong>\u2014stay alert to <strong>defend your homeland</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-up items</strong> randomly spawn on the battlefield. Collect them to boost:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archer Level</strong> (\u2191Range)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack Power</strong> (\u2191Damage)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archer Count</strong> (\u2191Targets)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack Speed</strong> (\u2191Fire Rate)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>endless waves of raptors</strong> and experience the <strong>cathartic joy of mowing them down</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>W</strong>&quot;/&quot;<strong>S</strong>&quot;: Move Elf Archer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>ESC</strong>&quot;: Pause Game</p></li></ul>",
